Files carrying an `SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0` header with Anthropic's copyright
are that project's, either used unmodified or adapted. `service/host.py`,
`service/sessions.py` and `service/memory.py` are vendored verbatim; the agent cores, tool
